From e31949fa05b1619d7357397d206c84d204687f1a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Henry Wu <Henry_Wu@quantatw.com>
Date: Wed, 22 Jul 2026 20:31:47 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] oem-meta: support MCTP I2C and I3C target configs

getSlotNumberStringByTID() currently only works for devices registered
as MCTPEndpoint, so endpoints exposed through MCTPI2Ctarget or
MCTPI3Ctarget may not have a matching configuration.

Add a fallback to append configuration data from the associated MCTP
target path when no MCTPEndpoint configuration is found. Also expose the
configuration path by TID and use it for Rainbow fault handling so the
fault inventory path is derived from the target configuration.

Signed-off-by: Henry Wu <Henry_Wu@quantatw.com>
